{"sections":[{"type":"Meta","title":"Which skills are employers seeking in your area?","description":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts ","contentTitle":"Title for google analytics","releaseDate":"2023-01-01","lastUpdated":"2023-01-01","outputSeries":"slugforoutputseries","contentType":"robo-journalism"},{"type":"Twisty","title":"These are \"statistics in development\". Learn more here.","content":"<p>This article presents “official statistics in development”. This means they are subject to revision, and may change in the future following user feedback.</p><p>Further information is included in the <a href=\"https://www.ons.gov.uk/employmentandlabourmarket/peopleinwork/employmentandemployeetypes/methodologies/measuringlabourdemandvolumesacrosstheukusingtextkerneldatauserguide\">accompanying user guide.</a></p>"},{"type":"Header","title":"Job adverts in Woking","label":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts. All London local authorities are combined. "},{"type":"Summary","title":"In Woking:","sections":[{"indicator":"Job adverts","value":"8.7","note":"","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in Woking was above the UK average. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#job_adverts\">More about job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Skills","value":"57%","note":"","content":"<p>In Surrey, East and West Sussex, a higher proportion of adverts in 2023 could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#skills\">More about skills</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Health","value":"54%","note":"","content":"<p>An average proportion of health and social care job adverts in Surrey, East and West Sussex could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#health\">More about health and social care job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"}]},{"id":"job_adverts","type":"Section","title":"In August 2024, there were more online job adverts than the UK average in Woking","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in Woking rose to 8.8 per 100 working-age residents (aged 16 to 64 years), from 7.2 adverts in August 2023. </p><p>This was higher than the UK average of 3.4 adverts per 100 working-age residents in August 2024. </p>"},{"id":"linechart","type":"Chart","chartType":"line","title":"Trends in job adverts","subtitle":"Trends in job adverts per 100 working-age residents in Woking, June 2017 to August 2024","footer":"Source: Textkernel, Office for National Statistics","data":[{"z":"Woking","x":"2017-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.830382923},{"z":"Woking","x":"2017-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":5.037717879},{"z":"Woking","x":"2017-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.993272763},{"z":"Woking","x":"2017-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.752528383},{"z":"Woking","x":"2017-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.194772408},{"z":"Woking","x":"2017-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.216239097},{"z":"Woking","x":"2017-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.16121181},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.691564334},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.807634142},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.602338032},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.947069143},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-04-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.654134656},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.778144093},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.919545097},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.676063154},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.456475712},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.447326236},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.590995705},{"z":"Woking","x":"2018-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.156130906},{"z":"Woking","x":"2019-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.090433279},{"z":"Woking","x":"2019-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.321029795},{"z":"Woking","x":"2019-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.509678985},{"z":"Woking",